  "description": "*\"I'm gay, so get out.\"* \n\nHa-Jeong meets Do-Young, a senior he met during a group project, and while enjoying the university festival together, he realizes for sure that he likes him. However, when the impromptu meeting is about to start, Do-Young suddenly comes out to him...?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of the 2024 Post Type Fall Anthology (\\[BL\\] 2024 포스타입 앤솔로지 | 가을).*",
